# PROJECT: VITALIA ACADEMY

## Complete Bilingual Educational Platform — Enterprise Edition

Act as a senior product designer, UX architect, frontend engineer, full-stack engineer, and educational technology specialist.

Build a comprehensive, premium, responsive educational platform called VITALIA ACADEMY.

This is NOT a simple landing page, static website, or generic LMS template.

Create a complete, multi-page educational ecosystem with connected navigation, realistic sample data, functional user interactions, role-based dashboards, course management interfaces, examination interfaces, certificate management, subscriptions, payment screens, academic administration, and platform analytics.

The initial implementation must prioritize a complete, polished, interactive frontend, with a clean architecture that supports integration with a real backend and database.

Do not stop after creating the homepage. Build the entire application.

